"本页全选" = "Select Page";
"将移动已选的 %@ 个文件到所选文件夹内的年月目录，未勾选的文件保持原位。同名时询问处理方式；已完成的移动或替换不会因停止而恢复原状。" = "Move the %@ selected files into year/month folders inside the selected folder. Unselected files stay in place. Name conflicts require a decision; stopping does not undo completed moves or replacements.";
