"本地文件复制校验失败，源文件已保留。" = "Local copy verification failed. The source file was kept.";
"文件系统未能保留原文件日期，源文件已保留。" = "The file system could not preserve the original dates. The source file was kept.";
"归档目标在复制期间发生变化，源文件已保留。" = "The archive target changed during copying. The source file was kept.";
"归档未完成，源文件已保留；副本清理失败：%@。原因：%@" = "Archiving did not finish. The source was kept, but the copy could not be removed: %@. Reason: %@";
"空间不足，兼容归档需要额外的文件副本空间和 64 MiB 预留。" = "Not enough space. Compatibility archiving needs room for one extra file copy plus a 64 MiB reserve.";
"正在校验源文件和副本…" = "Verifying the source and local copy…";
"正在本地复制：%@ / %@" = "Copying locally: %@ / %@";
"部分外接盘需先复制并校验，再移除源文件，需要额外空间。正常停止保留未完成的源文件；强退或拔盘可能留下副本。" = "Some external drives require copying and verification before removing the source, using extra space. Stopping normally keeps unfinished source files. Force quitting or disconnecting the drive may leave copies.";
"快速归档未完成，源文件未移动；占位文件清理失败：%@。原因：%@" = "Fast archiving did not finish. The source was not moved, but the placeholder could not be removed: %@. Reason: %@";
"同盘优先直接移动，磁盘不支持时才复制校验。归档时请避免其他程序同时写入同一目标目录。强退或拔盘可能留下占位文件或副本。" = "Files on the same volume are moved directly when supported; otherwise they are copied and verified. Avoid other apps writing to the same destination folder during archiving. Force quitting or disconnecting the drive may leave placeholders or copies.";
"按拍摄时间重命名" = "Rename by Capture Time";
"优先按拍摄时间命名，缺失时从文件名补充，同时同步创建和修改日期。" = "Name files using capture times, falling back to filename times, and synchronize creation and modification dates.";
"正在重命名" = "Renaming";
"内嵌创建时间" = "Embedded creation time";
"文件系统未能保留所需日期。" = "The file system could not preserve the requested dates.";
"日期同步失败，已尝试恢复原日期：%@" = "Date synchronization failed; restoring the original dates was attempted: %@";
"文件已重命名，但%@" = "The file was renamed, but %@";
"目标在重命名后发生变化，未同步日期，请重新扫描。" = "The target changed after renaming. Its dates were not changed. Scan again.";
"目标也是本次待重命名文件，请选择保留两者或跳过。" = "The target is also awaiting renaming in this task. Choose Keep Both or Skip.";
"待重命名文件：%@" = "File to rename: %@";
"保留两者会自动编号；跳过不改名或日期；替换会覆盖目标文件，再同步日期。" = "Keep Both adds a number. Skip leaves the name and dates unchanged. Replace overwrites the target, then synchronizes the dates.";
"待重命名文件" = "File to rename";
"应用到本次重命名的所有同名文件" = "Apply to all name conflicts in this rename task";
"停止重命名" = "Stop renaming";
"读取图片和视频的拍摄时间，缺失时从文件名补充，在原文件夹中重命名，并同步创建日期和修改日期。先预览，再确认处理，无需连接手机。" = "Read capture times from photos and videos, falling back to filename times, rename them in their existing folders, and synchronize creation and modification dates. Preview before confirming. No phone connection needed.";
"图片优先使用 EXIF 原始拍摄时间，其次内嵌创建时间；视频使用内嵌拍摄或创建时间。缺失时默认从文件名识别完整日期和时间，并标明来源；不使用文件系统日期。" = "Photos use EXIF original capture time, then embedded creation time. Videos use embedded capture or creation time. If unavailable, a full date and time in the filename is used by default and labeled in the preview. File system dates are not used.";
"图片：IMG_20151101_145451.jpg、IMG_20151101_145451.png；视频：VID_20250704_005959.mp4。保留原扩展名及大小写，不转换格式。" = "Photos: IMG_20151101_145451.jpg or IMG_20151101_145451.png. Videos: VID_20250704_005959.mp4. Original extensions and their case are preserved; formats are not converted.";
"文件名保留元数据记录的当地时间；文件日期按元数据时区解释。文件名补充或元数据没有时区时，使用 Mac 当前时区；仅有年月日的文件名跳过。" = "Names preserve the local time recorded in metadata; file dates respect the metadata time zone. Filename times and metadata without a time zone use the current Mac time zone. Filenames containing only a date are skipped.";
"扫描图片/视频" = "Scan Photos / Videos";
"重命名已选 %@ 个文件" = "Rename Selected (%@)";
"正在重命名 %@ / %@" = "Renaming %@ / %@";
"待处理：%@ · 名称和日期已符合：%@ · 无有效时间：%@" = "To process: %@ · Name and dates already match: %@ · No valid time: %@";
"名称和日期预览" = "Name and date preview";
"名称和日期已符合，无需处理" = "Name and dates already correct; no action needed";
"重命名已停止" = "Renaming stopped";
"已重命名 %@ 个 · 已同步日期 %@ 个 · 跳过 %@ 个 · 失败 %@ 个" = "Renamed: %@ · Dates synchronized: %@ · Skipped: %@ · Failed: %@";
"实际处理路径（最多 100 条）" = "Processed paths (up to 100)";
"只在原文件夹内重命名并同步日期，保留文件内容、EXIF 和原扩展名。元数据和文件名都没有有效时间、隐藏文件、链接、照片资料库及应用包不处理。停止保留已完成的重命名和日期同步。" = "Renames files in their existing folders and synchronizes dates, preserving contents, EXIF, and original extensions. Skips files with no valid time in metadata or filenames, hidden files, links, photo libraries, and app bundles. Stopping keeps completed renames and date changes.";
"确认重命名并同步文件日期？" = "Rename files and synchronize their dates?";
"开始重命名" = "Start Renaming";
"将处理已选的 %@ 个文件，在原文件夹内重命名，并把创建、修改日期同步为预览中的时间（优先元数据，缺失时使用文件名）。未选文件不处理；停止不会撤回已完成的更改。" = "Process the %@ selected files in their existing folders, renaming them and setting creation and modification dates to the previewed time (metadata first, then the filename). Unselected files are not processed. Stopping does not undo completed changes.";
"请至少选择图片或视频。" = "Select photos or videos to process.";
"图片/视频日期修复" = "Photo / Video Date Repair";
"修复图片和视频的创建日期，可选同步修改日期，保留原文件名。" = "Repair photo and video creation dates, optionally synchronize modification dates, and keep original filenames.";
"选择图片和视频所在的文件夹，先预览，再修复创建日期；可选同时修复修改日期。保留原文件名和格式，无需连接手机。" = "Choose a folder containing photos and videos, preview the dates, then repair creation dates with optional modification date repair. Original names and formats are preserved. No phone connection needed.";
"没有拍摄元数据时，从文件名识别日期" = "Use a date in the filename when capture metadata is unavailable";
"图片优先使用 EXIF，视频优先使用内嵌拍摄或创建时间；文件名日期仅作推测，请核对预览。20130607_190722、VID_20250704_005959 表示完整时间，20121209_015 仅恢复日期，015 不作为时间。" = "Photos use EXIF first; videos use embedded capture or creation times. Filename dates are guesses, so review the preview. 20130607_190722 and VID_20250704_005959 contain full times; 20121209_015 provides only a date, with 015 treated as a sequence number.";
"修复 %@ 个文件" = "Repair %@ Files";
"已检查 %@ 个（图片 %@、视频 %@）· 计划修复 %@ 个 · 日期一致 %@ 个" = "Checked: %@ (photos: %@, videos: %@) · Planned repairs: %@ · Already correct: %@";
"EXIF：%@ · 视频元数据：%@ · 文件名时间：%@ · 仅日期：%@" = "EXIF: %@ · Video metadata: %@ · Filename time: %@ · Date only: %@";
"创建日期预览（前 20 个）" = "Creation Date Preview (First 20 Files)";
"已修复 %@ 个 · 文件变化已跳过 %@ 个 · 失败 %@ 个" = "Repaired: %@ · Changed since scan: %@ skipped · Failed: %@";
"只调整文件日期，保留原文件名、图片和视频内容及内嵌元数据，不重新编码。默认只修复创建日期；勾选后同时修复修改日期。跳过隐藏文件、链接、资料库和无有效日期的文件。无时区按 Mac 当前时区解释，部分磁盘会按秒取整。停止或退出保留已完成的修复。" = "Only file dates are adjusted. Original names, photo and video contents, and embedded metadata are preserved without re-encoding. Creation dates are repaired by default; optionally repair modification dates too. Hidden files, links, libraries, and files without valid dates are skipped. Times without a zone use the current Mac time zone; some disks round to seconds. Stopping or quitting keeps completed repairs.";
